  "compassNorthTrueDesc": "Geographic north as on maps; feng shui and Qimen directions use this. Works indoors without internet or GPS.",
  "compassNorthTrueMore": "True north = magnetic north plus local declination (a few degrees). Declination changes only about 1° per 100+ km, so Wi‑Fi or cell location, or your last saved location, is accurate enough; no satellite signal needed indoors.",
